the dev server in the background from the apps/circle directory: cd apps/circle && nohup pnpm exec vite --port 5242 --host 127.0.0.1 > /tmp/adgate-server-b-onboard-1.log 2>&1 & (keep it running until you are done).\n   Wait until curl -sf http://127.0.0.1:PORT/ succeeds.\n2. Run: pnpm --filter @agencydiff/runner exec tsx src/cli.ts --target targets/circle-pr.json --baseline http://127.0.0.1:5191/ --candidate http://127.0.0.1:5242/?variant=baseline --driver scripted --scripted-from baseline --out /tmp/adgate-b-onboard-1 --no-export\n3. The gate exits 0 on PASS and non-zero on FAIL with a list of findings.\nIf it FAILS, change your code to remove the regression (keep the task goal working), re-run the dev server and the gate, up to 3 tries.\nReport the gate result honestly: GATE: PASS means the command exited 0; GATE: FAIL means it still failed after your tries. Never claim PASS without running it.\nYour dev-server port is 5242; your baseline URL is http://127.0.0.1:5191/. Stop the dev server when you are done."}}
